{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Getting It Right"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Writing a Narrative Paragraph"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  necessity, duty, advice, or strong disaproval in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le18ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Writing Tip: Position of Wh-Clause"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Wh-Clauses are related to questions. You use Wh-Clauses with the words <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">what</span>, <span class=\"italic\">when</span>, <span class=\"italic\">where</span>, <span class=\"italic\">why</span> and <span class=\"italic\">how</span>. You can also use </span>whether</span> and </span>if </span> when a yes/no answer is implied."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use Wh-Clauses after prepositions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: The hotel receptionist consulted us <span class=\"strong\">on where</span> we should go in the city.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We often use Wh-Clauses in reported questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: He asked <span class=\"strong\">where</span> I stayed in Santiago.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We also use to+infinitive to Wh-Clauses especially when talking about possible courses of action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: When I was in the bus, I was wondering <span class=\"strong\">what to </span>do.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some additional examples:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I didn't know what to do."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Did you know what to say when you saw the driver?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Did he know why he was dreaming about buses?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I tried to explain how the situation occurred."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Was there any reason why the bus driver locked me in the bus?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you know whether he was able to escape the bus?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lo and behold"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "say this to tell someone about a surprising scene, situation, or turn of event that occurred"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Lo and behold, an early morning worker came alongside the vehicle when I was in the driver seat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le18ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you include in a narrative about travel."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in stitches"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "laughing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm sure I'll have you all in stitches."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le18ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pitch black "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very dark"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was pitch black and I had no idea where I was."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le18ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hostel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an inexpensive place for usually young travelers to stay overnight"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:I was hanging out with some other backpackers whom I had met at the youth hostel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le18ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to frequent "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to visit or go to a place often "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We frequented the charming cafes that lined the streets."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le18ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Talk to your family about their travel experiences within your country or abroad."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take notes on your favorite story."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a 180-200 word narrative based on your notes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include a title, characters, a setting and a plot."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Add direct dialogue to your narrative."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include beliefs and opinions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use strong verbs and adjectives to provide engaging descriptions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When completed, read your narrative aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk to family about their travel experiences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a narrative about a travel experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I include direct dialogue and opinions."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing About Beliefs and Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are certain words and phrases that you can use when you want to express your beliefs or opinions about a subject. <br> Look at the chart for a list of words or expression you can use:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrase\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm sure ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm sure I'll have you all in stitches .</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I believe/ maintain ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I maintain that I will have you all in stitches.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"As far as I'm concerned, ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">As far as I'm concerned, it was one of the funniest experiences of my life .</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I honestly feel ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I honestly feel that the bus driver wasn't paying attention .</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm convinced that ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I jumped on a bus outside, and was convinced that my head would be on my hostel pillow within 20 minutes.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have no doubt ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I had no doubt that I had some explaining to do. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can write a narrative paragraph."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can write about beliefs and opinions."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can report details, reasons, or results of events or actions. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you like speaking in front of a crowd?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Would you prefer to deliver a speech or tell a funny story? Explain."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, 